This patch creates the `/extended/v1/tokens/nft/holdings` endpoint which returns a paginated list of all NFTs owned by any principal (contract or STX address).

The endpoint can:
* Return the `tx_id` or complete `tx` object of the transaction that led that principal to own each NFT
* Filter by `asset_identifier` so users can receive a list of only one type of NFT (arties, megapont, etc.)
* Return anchored and unanchored results

